# PrivPass – Environment Variables Example
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values.
# NEVER commit .env.local — it is gitignored.
#
# Usage:
#   cp .env.example .env.local    (Linux/macOS/Git Bash)
#   copy .env.example .env.local  (Windows cmd)
#   Then edit .env.local with your deployed contract address.

# ─── Network ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Options: preview | devnet
VITE_NETWORK=preview

# ─── Contract ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Deployed contract ID on the Preview Network.
# Run `npm run deploy -- --network preview` to get this address.
# Paste it here after deployment.
VITE_CONTRACT_ADDRESS=PENDING_DEPLOY

# ─── Indexer (GraphQL public data provider) ───────────────────────────────────
# Preview Network indexer (default — no change needed for Preview)
VITE_INDEXER_URL=https://indexer.preview.midnight.network

# Local devnet indexer (uncomment if using local Docker devnet)
# VITE_INDEXER_URL=http://localhost:8088

# ─── Proof Server ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Preview Network proof server (default)
VITE_PROOF_SERVER_URL=https://proof-server.preview.midnight.network

# Local devnet proof server (uncomment if using local Docker devnet)
# VITE_PROOF_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:6300
